@startuml
title Impresión — WebSerial y agente SBC
participant POS
participant "Print API" as API
queue "Print queue" as Q
participant "WebSerial" as SERIAL
participant "SBC agent" as SBC
participant "ESC/POS printer" as PRN
POS -> API : crear print_job(template, artifact)
API -> Q : job idempotente
alt navegador compatible
  Q -> SERIAL : job firmado/limitado
  SERIAL -> PRN : ESC/POS
  PRN --> SERIAL : estado
else cocina / entorno robusto
  Q -> SBC : outbound mTLS
  SBC -> PRN : ESC/POS
  PRN --> SBC : estado
end
SERIAL --> API : ack/failure
SBC --> API : ack/failure
note right of SBC
No calcula hash fiscal
ni comunica con AEAT.
end note
@enduml
